## Root Cause
The code directly uses user input (req.query.login) in rendering HTML without proper escaping, making it vulnerable to XSS.

## Explanation
The patch uses a templating method that automatically escapes user input, preventing malicious scripts from executing when the data is rendered in the HTML. This ensures that any user input included in the response is treated as plain text and not executable code.

